sequenceDiagram

actor Mesário
participant PoolWorkerTerminal
participant VotingServer
participant VotingTerminal
actor Votante

Mesário ->> PoolWorkerTerminal : Insere credenciais
Mesário ->> PoolWorkerTerminal : CONFIRMA

PoolWorkerTerminal ->> VotingServer : Credenciais

par Voter view
    VotingServer ->> VotingTerminal : Liberação
and Resposta mesário
    VotingServer -->> PoolWorkerTerminal : Notifica pra aguardar
    PoolWorkerTerminal -->> PoolWorkerTerminal : Aguarda
end

VotingTerminal ->> Votante : Tela de vereador

Votante ->> VotingTerminal : Numero
Votante ->> VotingTerminal : Numero
VotingTerminal ->> VotingServer : Requisita partido
VotingServer -->> VotingTerminal : Partido
VotingTerminal ->> VotingTerminal : Mostra partido

Votante ->> VotingTerminal : Numero
Votante ->> VotingTerminal : Numero
Votante ->> VotingTerminal : Numero
VotingTerminal ->> VotingServer : Requisita vereador
VotingServer -->> VotingTerminal : Vereador
VotingTerminal ->> VotingTerminal : Mostra vereador

Votante ->> VotingTerminal : CONFIRMA

VotingTerminal ->> Votante : Tela de prefeito

Votante ->> VotingTerminal : Numero
Votante ->> VotingTerminal : Numero

VotingTerminal ->> VotingServer : Requisita prefeito
VotingServer ->> VotingTerminal : Prefeito
VotingTerminal ->> VotingTerminal : Mostra prefeito

Votante ->> VotingTerminal : CONFIRMA

VotingTerminal ->> VotingServer : Confirmação

par Voter view
    VotingServer -->> VotingTerminal : Notifica conclusão
    VotingTerminal ->> VotingTerminal : Mostra FIM
and Resposta mesário
    VotingServer -->> PoolWorkerTerminal : Notifica conclusão
    PoolWorkerTerminal -->> PoolWorkerTerminal : Mostra desocupado
end
